{"seq":1,"slug":"types-inference","title":"类型与推断：从 OCaml 借来的 Hindley-Milner","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/grain-language/language/types-inference","wordCount":1314,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"类型与推断-从-ocaml-借来的-hindley-milner\">类型与推断：从 OCaml 借来的 Hindley-Milner</h1><p>写 Grain 时你会发现一件奇怪的事：几乎不用写类型，但每个类型错误都被逮个正着。这不是弱类型的松散，恰恰相反——Grain 的类型检查器源自 OCaml，用的是 Hindley-Milner（HM）类型系统，编译器能从代码结构反推出每个表达式的类型，精确程度不输你手写注解（<a href=\"https://serokell.io/blog/grain-with-oscar-spencer\">serokell.io</a>）。&quot;强类型却不啰嗦&quot;这个体验的全部秘密，就是 HM 的类型推断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-让编译器替你写类型\">核心概念：让编译器替你写类型</h2><p>考虑一个不带任何注解的 Grain 函数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"grain\" data-code=\"let rec map = (f, lst) =&gt; {&#10;  match (lst) {&#10;    [] =&gt; [],&#10;    [head, ...tail] =&gt; [f(head), ...map(f, tail)],&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let rec map = (f, lst) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  match (lst) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [] => [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [head, ...tail] => [f(head), ...map(f, tail)],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>你没写一个类型，但编译器推出 <code>map</code> 的类型是 <code>((a =&gt; b), List&lt;a&gt;) =&gt; List&lt;b&gt;</code>。它是怎么做到的？HM 推断分三步：给每个未知类型一个类型变量，沿着代码用法收集约束（<code>f</code> 被作用于 <code>head</code>，所以 <code>f</code> 是函数；结果被 cons 进列表……），再用<strong>合一算法</strong>（unification）解这组约束，得到每个变量的最一般解。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[源码表达式] --&gt; B[为每个子表达式分配类型变量]&#10;    B --&gt; C[遍历用法收集约束方程]&#10;    C --&gt; D[合一算法求解约束]&#10;    D --&gt; E{是否可解}&#10;    E --&gt;|可解| F[得到最一般类型 principal type]&#10;    E --&gt;|冲突| G[类型错误, 编译期报错]&#10;    F --&gt; H[let 泛化: 自由变量变多态]\">graph TD\n    A[源码表达式] --&gt; B[为每个子表达式分配类型变量]\n    B --&gt; C[遍历用法收集约束方程]\n    C --&gt; D[合一算法求解约束]\n    D --&gt; E{是否可解}\n    E --&gt;|可解| F[得到最一般类型 principal type]\n    E --&gt;|冲突| G[类型错误, 编译期报错]\n    F --&gt; H[let 泛化: 自由变量变多态]</pre><p>关键性质是 HM 保证：只要程序类型正确，推断出的类型一定是<strong>最一般类型</strong>（most general / principal type）——不多不少，恰好覆盖所有合法用法。这就是为什么上面的 <code>map</code> 自动变成对任意 <code>a</code>、<code>b</code> 都成立的多态函数，而你一个字都没多写。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合一算法-约束求解的引擎\">合一算法：约束求解的引擎</h2><p>推断的心脏是合一。给定两个类型，合一试图找到一个变量替换（substitution）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 使两者相等。规则很简洁：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>两个相同的具体类型（如 <code>Number</code> 与 <code>Number</code>）：合一成功，不产生新约束。</li>\n<li>一个类型变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 与任意类型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>：令 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>↦</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma = [\\alpha \\mapsto \\tau]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↦</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，前提是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 不出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 中（occurs check，防止 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>List</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha = \\text{List}(\\alpha)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">List</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 这类无限类型）。</li>\n<li>两个构造类型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(\\tau_1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(\\tau_2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：递归合一 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>否则：合一失败，报类型错误。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>整个推断就是从空替换出发，逐条约束地合一、把替换叠加。用形式记号，若约束集为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>≐</mo><msubsup><mi>τ</mi><mn>1</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>≐</mo><msubsup><mi>τ</mi><mi>n</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{\\tau_1 \\doteq \\tau_1&#x27;, \\dots, \\tau_n \\doteq \\tau_n&#x27;\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≐</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.2481em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4519em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≐</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0019em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，算法输出最一般合一子（most general unifier）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>σ</mi><msubsup><mi>τ</mi><mi>i</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma\\tau_i = \\sigma\\tau_i&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0106em;vertical-align:-0.2587em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 成立。这套算法（常称 Algorithm W）的通用理论属于类型系统的公共知识，本篇只讲它在 Grain 里的落地形态；形式化细节见 <a href=\"../../type-systems/inference-and-polymorphism/type-inference\">类型系统：类型推断</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"let-多态与泛化\">let 多态与泛化</h2><p>推断到&quot;最一般类型&quot;还不够，要真正多态还需要<strong>泛化</strong>（generalization）。当一个 <code>let</code> 绑定的类型里含自由类型变量，HM 会把它们全称量化，让这个绑定在不同调用点以不同具体类型使用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"grain\" data-code=\"let identity = (x) =&gt; x   // 推断为 forall a. a =&gt; a&#10;let n = identity(42)      // 此处 a = Number&#10;let s = identity(&quot;grain&quot;) // 此处 a = String\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let identity = (x) => x   // 推断为 forall a. a => a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let n = identity(42)      // 此处 a = Number</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let s = identity(\"grain\") // 此处 a = String</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>identity</code> 被泛化为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall a.\\ a \\to a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>，两次调用各自实例化。注意泛化只发生在 let 绑定处、且只对不被外层约束的变量——这条&quot;let 多态&quot;规则正是 HM 在表达力与可判定性之间的平衡点：它放弃了更强的高阶多态（那会让推断不可判定），换来&quot;永远推得出、永远不用注解&quot;的实用性。</p>\n<p>下表把推断过程中三种&quot;类型状态&quot;的区别理清，这是初学者最容易混淆的地方：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>类型变量（type variable）</td>\n<td>尚未确定的占位，待合一求解</td>\n<td>推断中间态的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单态类型（monotype）</td>\n<td>具体、无量词的类型</td>\n<td><code>Number</code>、<code>List&lt;String&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型模式（type scheme）</td>\n<td>泛化后带全称量词的多态类型</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall a.\\ a \\to a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>推断的本质就是：从满是类型变量的骨架出发，合一求出单态类型，再在 let 处泛化成类型模式，供后续实例化回单态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么时候仍需注解-以及类型如何落到-wasm\">什么时候仍需注解，以及类型如何落到 wasm</h2><p>HM 强大但不是万能，Grain 里有几种情况你会主动写类型：为公开 API 写文档性签名、给递归数据类型定命名、或在推断出的类型比你想要的更宽时收窄。Grain 的语法允许在参数与返回处标注，如 <code>(x: Number) =&gt; x + 1</code>。</p>\n<p>还要记住：这些精巧的类型信息在编译后<strong>几乎全部抹除</strong>——wasm 运行时没有类型，安全性已在编译期锁死。类型如何影响数据的内存布局与标签（tag），属于运行时话题，见 <a href=\"../runtime/compilation-model\">编译模型（到 WASM）</a> 与 <a href=\"../runtime/memory-gc\">内存与垃圾回收</a>。类型系统与后两篇的关系是：推断给出精确类型 → 代数数据类型用它们构造数据形状 → 模式匹配靠它们做穷尽性检查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Grain 的类型检查器源自 OCaml，用 Hindley-Milner 做全局类型推断，&quot;强类型却几乎零注解&quot;。</li>\n<li>推断三步：分配类型变量 → 收集约束 → 合一求解，保证得到最一般类型。</li>\n<li>合一算法带 occurs check，防止无限类型；求解输出最一般合一子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>let 多态在绑定处泛化自由变量，是 HM 表达力与可判定性的平衡点。</li>\n<li>类型在编译后基本抹除，安全性锁在编译期；它是 ADT 与模式匹配的前提。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"adt-records\">代数数据类型与记录</a>——用推断出的类型构造数据形状；<a href=\"pattern-matching\">模式匹配</a>——类型如何驱动穷尽性检查。</li>\n<li>通用理论：<a href=\"../../type-systems/inference-and-polymorphism/type-inference\">类型系统：类型推断</a>——HM 与 Algorithm W 的形式化。</li>\n<li>血缘来源：<a href=\"../../ocaml-functional-systems/foundations/type-inference\">OCaml：类型推断</a>——Grain 类型检查器所源自的语言。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"类型与推断：从 OCaml 借来的 Hindley-Milner","id":"类型与推断-从-ocaml-借来的-hindley-milner"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：让编译器替你写类型","id":"核心概念-让编译器替你写类型"},{"level":2,"text":"合一算法：约束求解的引擎","id":"合一算法-约束求解的引擎"},{"level":2,"text":"let 多态与泛化","id":"let-多态与泛化"},{"level":2,"text":"什么时候仍需注解，以及类型如何落到 wasm","id":"什么时候仍需注解-以及类型如何落到-wasm"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"Grain 与 Rust/AssemblyScript 对比：把它放进坐标系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/grain-language/foundations/grain-vs-others"},"next":{"title":"代数数据类型与记录：把数据的形状说清楚","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/grain-language/language/adt-records"}}